[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふあー、疲れた……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew, I'm beat...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お疲れさま。調合の状況はどう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good work. How's the synthesis coming along?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんとか上手くいくかなー。フロッケの科学の知識も\n合わさっていい感じにまとまりそう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think it's going pretty well. With Flocke's scientific knowledge, everything's coming together nicely."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "最初はどうなることかと思ったけど、\nフロッケさんとはずいぶん仲良くなれた気がするね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "At first I wasn't sure how it would turn out, but I feel like we've really gotten close with Flocke."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほんとほんと。ハイディのほうはまだ\nトゲトゲしてるけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, totally! Though Heidi's still a bit prickly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それで、プレゼン資料のほうは？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, how's the presentation material coming?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "んー、もう一押しっていうところかな。\nなんとなく、これでいいのかなって不安があって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, it needs one final push. I just have this nagging feeling that it might not be good enough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "面白いものが作れてると思うけど、\nそれでも不安なんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even though I think we've made something interesting, I'm still anxious about it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いつもはプラフタが一緒だったから。\n細かいところによく気付くんだよね、プラフタは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Usually Plachta would be with us. She always notices the little details."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは。確かに、隙はありません！\u3000っていう\n感じだもんね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha! She definitely gives off that 'nothing gets past me' vibe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だからちょっと意外なんだよね。\nプラフタが自分のグッズとか出してるの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's why it's kind of surprising, you know? Seeing Plachta merchandise proliferate without her knowledge."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういうことしなさそうなタイプに見えるんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She doesn't seem like the type who'd miss something like that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふふ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hehe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん、どうしたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm? What is it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん、なんでも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, it's nothing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you say so..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにしても、もうすぐ発表かあ。\nあっという間だったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Anyway, the presentation's almost here. Time really flew by, huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。楽しいからかな。時間が過ぎるのが\n早く感じたかも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. Maybe because we've been having fun, but it felt like time really flew."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしもすっごく楽しい！\nきっと将来もこういうことしてるんだろうなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm having a blast too! I bet this is the kind of thing we'll be doing in the future."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……将来も？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...In the future?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だってさ。今回の実習って、\n仕事してるみたいな感じじゃん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, yeah. This practical exercise feels a lot like having a real job, don't you think?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "将来もさ。あたしが商品を作って、クラウディアが\n戦略を立てて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In the future, I could be making products, and you could be developing strategies..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうなることもあるのかなって思ったら、\nなんだかワクワクする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just thinking about that possibility gets me all excited!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか。そういうことも、あるかもしれないんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. Something like that... could happen, huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Ryza."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私ね、転校してライザと別れた時、もしかしたら\nもう二度と会えないのかなって思ってたんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When I transferred schools and we parted ways, I thought maybe we'd never see each other again."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、またこうして会えて……やっぱりライザと\n一緒の時間は、すごく楽しくて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But here we are together again... All the time that I spend with you is so enjoyable..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "離れたくないなって思っちゃった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've realized I don't want us to be apart."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クラウディア……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だけどね。今のライザの話を聞いてね。\nちょっと将来が楽しみになったんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But you know what? After hearing what you just said, I'm now looking forward to what the future hold."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すごいね、ライザは。いつも私の道を照らしてくれる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're amazing, Ryza. You've always lit the path ahead for me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そう？\u3000大したことしたつもりは\nないけど……でも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "R-really? I don't think I did anything special, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クラウディアの力になれたならよかった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm glad that I was able to help you in some way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにさ。きっとあたしも同じなんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And you know what? I feel the same way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クラウディアと一緒の将来を想像したのは、\nクラウディアといると楽しいからなんだろうなって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The reason I imagined a future with you is because I have so much fun when we're together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ライザ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫。離れたって、あたしたちは一生友達だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry. Even if we're apart, we'll be friends for life."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……うん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'd like that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]